{"id":"mois","lemma":"mois","pos":"noun","rank":234,"glosses":["month"],"ipa":"/mwa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Fr-mois.ogg/Fr-mois.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Ça fait un mois.","en":"It's been a month.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097780","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je te verrai dans trois mois.","en":"I'll see you in three months.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Voici votre salaire du mois dernier.","en":"Here are your wages for the last month.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"salary, wage"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"last"}]},{"text":"Dans quelques mois, ce sera oublié.","en":"It'll be forgotten in a few months' time.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to forget","l":"oublier"}]},{"text":"Le mois prend fin.","en":"The month is drawing to an end.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"end, close, finish"}]}]}